  <item>
    <title>东京美食大推荐</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c4b5acbf52a16cd10f8b16</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c4b5acbf52a16cd10f8b16</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 03 Mar 2025 09:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>前35分钟是我们半个月东京行的零散回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span>后面的全是东京美食推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>这里会放食物的图片</span></p><span></span><p><span>具体的饭店地址可以去🍠蟹老板Emma 那里配合着看</span></p><span></span><p><span>创意烧鸟</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv5eSY66WThOZ_HCn6yPjI1NaB41.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>东京网红蛋糕</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Foz1ry8AJEKSQsOJnCeRQlj01_JS.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>酒店边上三杯咖啡套餐+brunch</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpc7zCRSbpkWt3FNpim7N_fkewqG.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>章鱼小丸子</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtKj6Fa3hbQEuEHx-op6itrQ84hZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>汤咖喱</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhzya3jI4SJ7HvGXLg9LqmDH_NRV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>百年老店 炸猪排</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnoaqbGdi6e4cJNogWXI1LAIXBzx.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>难吃的创新炸饺子及中华料理韭菜炒蛋</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgXG9gk2F84SxlOXSRpYEmpvaE_A.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>大阪烧</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlPp544B2KK3Pzm-yVv9moOmD44K.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>旋转寿司</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo5YO2AX6sGsC9_4jl0KDyK3KO5k.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>中华料理素食店</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjyljCYDxk6w2ba1ijryeWDX9lw6.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>中华料理bistro（白子）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhebVzWV-jv7NB8sCVRHuvE3IvCg.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>汉堡肉西式</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhlsDMsGt0qtFm-jpt8pw2ZEUXXk.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>冰激凌烤红薯</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgxRkAaf0LiRv243gOxW8cBP3WKt.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>最强汉堡肉</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp4_3-Vw-m8lEjug63SE7RNScyAq.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>一兰拉面</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqLTnLBYqzVpyt7DSWp4AV9xWR4x.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>油面</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkz9fRBIwUQJytogaHJNEyV4Oy_b.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>沾面</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhK31vS7A_ywDFVS0RyFf1bC8iER.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>北海道拉面</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlfDIET2baHTyou3C0wly_syBPQH.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>柚子拉面</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv1TuNKhw1ylku0fwBthFfNxZk6g.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>火山牛肉饭</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhtQLued4qpN2LhsE0mm3qUGgJs7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>土耳其烤肉卷饼</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiCJ60ohxUauaWRWzMVWS3xdCWSB.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>gelato甜品</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvWPSZPeWskrZDZGPwQ5Kd0NfYYG.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>超级难吃的居酒屋</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fif8zr_JELIxMKtEbZenrv7OGxU2.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>烧肉</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlxWU9CUnP-9jg0Lb5ciSOl5R9lv.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>和牛寿喜锅</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiYu5ecm0Zj6pLHSouOhgF1CFg4p.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>KITH麦片冰激凌</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu6p2FQaKdwmXslQWqE9BeSecOug.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>coldstone</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmm98fzDj5SGNMj2T6MuH3fBfQ4w.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6235b323a16a9f1bf0bc2972/lvuQRCWT4q_246hZCXPhv7nPU_Y5.m4a" length="175726137" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>02:01:04</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsfDONh2eK_UCtOpps1OzM5jaQCo.png"/>
